# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true gives a Windows clone CRLF working files
# while the index holds LF. Prettier defaults to endOfLine: "lf", so it reports
# every file in the repo as needing reformatting and `npm run check` fails on a
# clean checkout — which means the check carries no signal, and a real
# formatting regression is indistinguishable from the noise. Running
# `npm run format` appears to fix it and then commits nothing, because git
# normalises the line endings straight back out again.
#
# The frontend repo already carries this file; the backend was missing it.
* text=auto eol=lf
